    "Collects every IPv4 address in the Received headers into the column received_ips and tags emails that passed through a private address (10.x, 172.16–31.x, 192.168.x) with private-hop — a sign the message was relayed inside a company network. A recipe can do either part: \"Received IP addresses — is in IP range\" for the tag, or a column with the value {received_ips}." : {
      "comment" : "Help text for a bundled script that collects and tags IP addresses from email Received headers.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sammelt jede IPv4-Adresse aus den Received-Headern in der Spalte received_ips und taggt E-Mails, die über eine private Adresse liefen (10.x, 172.16–31.x, 192.168.x), mit private-hop — ein Zeichen, dass die Nachricht innerhalb eines Firmennetzes weitergeleitet wurde. Ein Rezept kann jeden Teil allein: „IP-Adressen in Received — liegt im IP-Bereich“ für den Tag oder eine Spalte mit dem Wert {received_ips}."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reúne cada dirección IPv4 de los encabezados Received en la columna received_ips y etiqueta con private-hop los correos que pasaron por una dirección privada (10.x, 172.16–31.x, 192.168.x), señal de que el mensaje se reenvió dentro de una red corporativa. Una receta puede hacer cualquiera de las dos partes: «Direcciones IP de Received — está en el rango IP» para la etiqueta, o una columna con el valor {received_ips}."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rassemble chaque adresse IPv4 des en-têtes Received dans la colonne received_ips et étiquette private-hop les e-mails passés par une adresse privée (10.x, 172.16–31.x, 192.168.x) — signe d’un relais au sein d’un réseau d’entreprise. Une recette peut faire l’une ou l’autre partie : « Adresses IP des en-têtes Received — est dans la plage IP » pour l’étiquette, ou une colonne avec la valeur {received_ips}."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Received हेडर के हर IPv4 पते को received_ips कॉलम में इकट्ठा करता है और जो ईमेल किसी निजी पते (10.x, 172.16–31.x, 192.168.x) से होकर गए उन पर private-hop टैग लगाता है — संकेत कि संदेश किसी कंपनी नेटवर्क के अंदर आगे भेजा गया। रेसिपी कोई भी एक हिस्सा कर सकती है: टैग के लिए “Received की IP पते — IP रेंज में है”, या {received_ips} मान वाला कॉलम।"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Raccoglie ogni indirizzo IPv4 delle intestazioni Received nella colonna received_ips e tagga private-hop le email passate da un indirizzo privato (10.x, 172.16–31.x, 192.168.x), segno di un inoltro dentro una rete aziendale. Una ricetta può fare l’una o l’altra parte: «Indirizzi IP di Received — è nell’intervallo IP» per il tag, oppure una colonna con il valore {received_ips}."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Received ヘッダーのすべての IPv4 アドレスを列 received_ips にまとめ、プライベートアドレス（10.x、172.16–31.x、192.168.x）を経由したメールに private-hop タグを付けます（社内ネットワーク内で中継された兆候）。レシピではどちらか一方を作れます: タグには「Received の IP アドレス — IP 範囲内」、列には値 {received_ips}。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Received 헤더의 모든 IPv4 주소를 received_ips 열에 모으고, 사설 주소(10.x, 172.16–31.x, 192.168.x)를 거친 이메일에 private-hop 태그를 붙입니다. 메시지가 회사 네트워크 안에서 중계되었다는 신호입니다. 레시피로는 둘 중 하나를 만들 수 있습니다: 태그는 “Received IP 주소 — IP 범위에 포함”, 열은 값 {received_ips}."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reúne cada endereço IPv4 dos cabeçalhos Received na coluna received_ips e etiqueta com private-hop os e-mails que passaram por um endereço privado (10.x, 172.16–31.x, 192.168.x) — sinal de retransmissão dentro de uma rede corporativa. Uma receita pode fazer qualquer uma das partes: “Endereços IP de Received — está no intervalo de IP” para a etiqueta, ou uma coluna com o valor {received_ips}."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把 Received 标头中的每个 IPv4 地址收集到 received_ips 列，并给经过私有地址（10.x、172.16–31.x、192.168.x）的邮件加上 private-hop 标签——说明邮件在公司网络内被转发。配方可完成其中任一部分：标签用“Received 中的 IP 地址 — 在 IP 范围内”，列用值 {received_ips}。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把 Received 標頭中的每個 IPv4 位址收集到 received_ips 欄位，並為經過私有位址（10.x、172.16–31.x、192.168.x）的郵件加上 private-hop 標籤——表示郵件在公司網路內被轉送。配方可完成其中任一部分：標籤用「Received 中的 IP 位址 — 在 IP 範圍內」，欄位用值 {received_ips}。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
