    "Deep recovery also scans the unused space of %@ of PST/OST data — about %lld–%lld s more." : {
      "comment" : "A paragraph describing the additional time it will take to scan the unused space of PST/OST files. The first argument is the size of the PST/OST files. The second argument is the estimated time in seconds.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
