    "Imported %lld, updated %lld, rejected %lld. Signatures in %lld messages will be checked again." : {
      "comment" : "A note summarizing the results of a public key import. The first argument is the number of keys that were imported. The second argument is the number of keys that were updated. The third argument is the number of keys that were rejected. The fourth argument is the number of messages that had their signatures re-verified.",
