    "Personal and Professional are each offered monthly, yearly, or as a one-time lifetime purchase. Professional includes everything in Personal. Prices are shown by the App Store in your currency." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Personal und Professional gibt es jeweils monatlich, jährlich oder als einmaligen lebenslangen Kauf. Professional enthält alles aus Personal. Preise zeigt der App Store in Ihrer Währung."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Personal y Professional se ofrecen mensual, anual o como compra única de por vida. Professional incluye todo lo de Personal. Los precios los muestra el App Store en tu moneda."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Personal et Professional sont chacun proposés en mensuel, annuel ou en achat unique à vie. Professional inclut tout ce que contient Personal. Les prix sont affichés par l'App Store dans votre devise."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Personal और Professional प्रत्येक मासिक, वार्षिक या एकमुश्त आजीवन खरीद के रूप में उपलब्ध हैं। Professional में Personal की हर चीज़ शामिल है। कीमतें App Store आपकी मुद्रा में दिखाता है।"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Personal e Professional sono offerti ciascuno con abbonamento mensile, annuale o come acquisto unico a vita. Professional include tutto ciò che offre Personal. I prezzi sono mostrati dall'App Store nella tua valuta."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Personal と Professional はそれぞれ月額、年額、または一回限りのライフタイム購入で提供されます。Professional には Personal のすべてが含まれます。価格は App Store がお住まいの通貨で表示します。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Personal과 Professional은 각각 월간, 연간 또는 일회성 평생 구입으로 제공됩니다. Professional에는 Personal의 모든 것이 포함됩니다. 가격은 App Store에서 사용자의 통화로 표시됩니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Personal e Professional são oferecidos cada um em plano mensal, anual ou como compra única vitalícia. O Professional inclui tudo do Personal. Os preços são exibidos pela App Store na sua moeda."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Personal 和 Professional 均提供按月、按年或一次性终身购买。Professional 包含 Personal 的全部内容。价格由 App Store 以您的货币显示。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Personal 和 Professional 均提供按月、按年或一次性終身購買。Professional 包含 Personal 的全部內容。價格由 App Store 以您的貨幣顯示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
