    "Showing %lld of %lld awaiting verdict — the next ones load when these are done; every intake and verdict is recorded in the audit trail" : {
      "comment" : "A description of the triage queue, showing the number of emails in the current queue and the total count of pending emails. The argument is optional and is only shown when the pending count is greater than the queue count.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld von %2$lld warten auf ein Urteil — die nächsten werden geladen, sobald diese erledigt sind; jede Aufnahme und jedes Urteil wird im Prüfprotokoll festgehalten"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Showing %1$lld of %2$lld awaiting verdict — the next ones load when these are done; every intake and verdict is recorded in the audit trail"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se muestran %1$lld de %2$lld que esperan veredicto; los siguientes se cargan al terminar estos. Cada entrada y cada veredicto quedan registrados en el registro de auditoría"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld affichés sur %2$lld en attente de verdict — les suivants se chargent une fois ceux-ci traités ; chaque prise en charge et chaque verdict sont consignés dans le journal d'audit"
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "निर्णय की प्रतीक्षा में %2$lld में से %1$lld दिखाए जा रहे हैं — इनके पूरे होने पर अगले लोड होंगे; हर प्रविष्टि और निर्णय ऑडिट ट्रेल में दर्ज होता है"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld di %2$lld in attesa di verdetto mostrati — i successivi si caricano quando questi sono completati; ogni acquisizione e ogni verdetto sono registrati nel registro di audit"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "判定待ち %2$lld 件中 %1$lld 件を表示 — これらが終わると次が読み込まれます。すべての受付と判定は監査証跡に記録されます"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "판정 대기 %2$lld건 중 %1$lld건 표시 — 이 항목을 마치면 다음 항목을 불러옵니다. 모든 접수와 판정은 감사 추적에 기록됩니다"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Exibindo %1$lld de %2$lld aguardando veredito — os próximos carregam quando estes forem concluídos; cada entrada e cada veredito ficam registrados na trilha de auditoria"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示 %2$lld 个等待裁定中的 %1$lld 个——完成后将载入后续项目；每次接收和裁定都会记录在审计记录中"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
